  "title": "Skyward Specialty Launches New Industry-First Well Decommissioning Solution - Skyward Specialty Insurance",
  "summary": "Skyward Specialty Insurance Group announced the launch of Skyward Specialty EndWell Protection, an industry-first well decommissioning solution built on an escrow-secured bond model. Designed to address capacity and collateral challenges in the energy sector, EndWell Protection offers a transparent, efficient alternative to traditional surety solutions, reinforcing Skyward Specialty’s commitment to developing specialized products in underserved markets.",
